            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Use the past perfect continuous for the earlier process. Start with the main-clause subject; do not move time or reason phrases to the front. Identify an ongoing, repeated sound in the preceding afternoon as coming from the alarm.",
